    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metrics ingest per copy",
      "description": "Per second, samples written to each VMSingle (vm_rows_inserted_total). The agents write everything to both copies, so the two lines should match; a gap means one copy is behind (its agent queue grows) or missing data.",
